<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-17T22:29:52.914Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 22:29:52 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Turkish foreign minister praised Iraqi premier's vision while meeting Hakan Fidan to discuss water cooperation and regional security in Baghdad. Iranian Kurdish opposition groups in Erbil province faced multiple attacks, including two explosions reported near their base and a drone strike on a Komala facility. The Popular Mobilization Forces suffered casualties when a scrap collector was shot dead near a PMF site in Baghdad and an internal malfunction caused an explosion at a PMF headquarters, killing one member and wounding four. These incidents show a rise in attacks on Iranian-linked opposition and internal PMF accidents, alongside ongoing diplomatic engagement, and 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOS0ZRQVplY0hrbFQ2RnlvdUl5NjYtcUFxNFVmTmJZaktsU05kOHpTOWNRRmsxcEZPVlBraEx6SmQ1aGdPd0NzdmxOUVFrSUxuLUY1Y3cwZlNERmh6QWlUNVRoRjRFdmxnejUwN0pPUHJ2dkp3eHcybHVvN3RhSDV4SnJ5amxsYkg5Y1E5dGlzQjhYYWp0dXU3MTdHQktYQ2tkdTVSdXFGNDlPQ3VFTjZ2REU0Sk8xMUZHdzE2bzRyRTEwWm5Jb2VHMXRxNlg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ahram Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPd1FEcUVoSDNuQ08zaThGX3JvNXJfWThlZ1ZueTg2MXdod2Vjc0tETWZtci1rbm1hSXFVUGVoWXhYdkNjd3BjdXFBbUV0MldqcTFJd204SUhfQmU2REUzdVBqTkU4alJmZWxLejZOcGlZT05aUjgwTFo4V0tmUmVkbHVHZzBhc0I4bWFnV0dhWlYtd1Y1bWdsYzFyVFY4Q20tSlI1WWw3d01MaWM3UEFsZFdn?oc=5&quot;&gt;İlke Haber Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE1hUm9iTEVuN2I4OUZTUGhjdUhiUTBwT1dhUUVENnVTSlNkMkY3RTFHaHF2T3VtWGFjX0JEU3AwU2N6UGlEMFFHNE05RQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOVzZXcFFLNlo5elZGWEc3MWFibkRXLThrOGktSjJWZ2